MID_LGV_1LED_c01_LG14_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c01_LG14_001_m01_001: The fire spread to Father's viceroy office...and it\nlooks like a mess inside.
MID_LGV_1LED_c01_LG14_001_m01_002: I should hurry. I think {SetColor=Gold}Obsidian{SetColor=Default} is being stored in the\n{SetColor=Gold}back{SetColor=Default} of the treasury.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_GM14_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_GM14_001_m01_001: Our destination is farther down the road, beyond the\nmountain pass.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_GM14_001_m01_002: Given the situation with Mu's mother, I'd suggest\nwe move quickly.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_LG14_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_LG14_003_m01_001: Kassite still bears the scars of the war.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_LG14_003_m01_002: Let's go try to {SetColor=Gold}learn what we can{SetColor=Default} about {SetColor=Gold}Balboa{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_DN14_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_DN14_001_m01_001: Our target—General Balboa—is somewhere inside\nthis mine.
MID_LGV_1LED_c02_DN14_001_m01_002: I'm not letting her escape. Come on. Let's\n{SetColor=Gold}search for her{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_004_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_004_m01_001: I'm not sure I can even bear to go to Kalla's temple\nand face her now.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_004_m01_002: There's somewhere I have to go first.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m01_001: Even among the temples, hardly anything is known\nabout the ghost carriage.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m01_002: In truth, I thought its existence a silly rumor. I never\nimagined I'd see it with my own eyes.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m02_001: Ahh, it appears this is where we must part ways.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m02_002: To where are you headed, if you don't mind\nme asking?
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m02_003: Oho, let's see! From here, I'll make my way south\ntoward Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_GM14_006_m02_004: Perhaps we'll cross paths again though—if destiny\nwills it.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_005_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_005_m01_001: I have business to attend to at the branch temple.\nTime to part ways, Leilidahna.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_005_m01_002: But before I depart, let me give you a little gold to\ncover your expenses as you prepare for the match.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_005_m01_003: The {SetColor=Gold}Heroic Games {SetColor=Default}are to be held in the {SetColor=Gold}colosseum{SetColor=Default}\ndown the path. You ought to make your way there.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m01_001: Ugh, I feel like crap. Maybe going to a tavern or\nsomething would cheer me up.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m02_001: Stop, please! Leave me alone!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m02_002: You're not going anywhere, missy. Maybe a little\nhurtin' will make you more pliant!
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_006_m02_003: Damn it, another scumbag. It looks like she's\nin trouble... Hey, you. Get away from her!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m01_001: I don't want to take any chances during the new\nmoon. Buccar, maybe we could hire a mercenary?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m01_002: Certainly. I'll look for candidates.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_001: I searched all over the city and found someone who\nfits milady's criteria. She's here with me.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_002: Hmm... I see. So you're the one who wanted to\nhire me. Do I have that right?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_003: Forgive me for being forward, but I don't like wasting\ntime on niceties. Will you help me out?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_004: I'm sorry, but I must decline. I cannot serve you.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_005: Why not?! What is it that displeases you?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_006: You may not realize that I am of noble birth. I could\nnever work for someone with an uncertain status.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_007: Without getting into specifics... I'm not exactly\nlowborn, if that's your worry.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_008: Still, I have no intention of selling my services in\nsuch a low manner—to just any so-and-so.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_009: Now, if you were someone whose name was known\nacross Dagda, I would be happy to serve you.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m02_010: I will wield my spear for you once you're a more\ncelebrated figure. Now, if you'll pardon me...
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m03_001: A chilling rejection. Perhaps if you give her this\nnext time, you'll be more warmly received.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m04_001: Wants me to be "celebrated," she says. The hell?\nHow pompous can you get?!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m04_002: Let's calm our emotions and think it over rationally.\nPerhaps over some ghosh at the tavern?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_103_m04_003: *sigh* Is that supposed to be a come-on? I guess I'll\nindulge you this once.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m01_001: I didn't notice how impressive this tavern's stage is.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m01_002: Is there a performance today? Seems more crowded\nthan before...
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m01_003: AAH! You there!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02_001: You're beautiful! And that outfit—you're a dancer,\nI take it?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02_002: See...our scheduled performer canceled last-minute\ndue to an injury.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02_003: The owner's tearing his hair out to find a\nreplacement. So, would you take the stage?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02_004: Not really why I'm here. But dancing a little\nsounds nice, if just for one song.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m02_005: I'll go and have a {SetColor=Gold}chat {SetColor=Default}with the {SetColor=Gold}owner{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m03_001: I hear you're filling in? Thank the gods! Our salvation\nhas arrived!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m03_002: The audience is getting restless. Sorry for the rush,\nbut please, get started right away!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m04_001: Would you look at that... As I slipped into the rhythm\nof the dance, a new melody came to me.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m04_002: Maybe this stage can be a source of inspiration.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m04_003: Leda, right? After that performance, your name will\nbe known all over the city!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_001: You caught me on a bit of an odd day... The day I'm\npacking it up and closing this place for good.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_002: Had to be done. At least, with that performance,\nI can say I went out on a high note. So, thank y—
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_003: Can I do that again?!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_004: Ah—sorry. Like I said...
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_005: I can {SetColor=Gold}increase my renown {SetColor=Default}and {SetColor=Gold}increase my abilities{SetColor=Default}.\nIt's exactly what I need right now!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_006: Please, let me keep performing! And I'll help you\nout however I can. What do you say?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_007: Hmmm... Well, I have been hearing a lot of requests\nfor a performer.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_008: I was of a mind to turn them down, but if you\nwanted to take them... Hmmm.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_001_m05_009: One was from a village nearby. Why not go and\ntreat them to a performance?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_002_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_002_GM_m01_001: It was {SetColor=Gold}Yaaman {SetColor=Menu}that the request came from, {SetColor=Gold}{SetColor=Default}right?\nThen c'mon, Leda! Let's go!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_002_GM_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_002_GM_m02_001: We have arrived. Ready to put on a {SetColor=Gold}performance{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_107_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_107_GM_m01_001: That {SetColor=Gold}secret spot{SetColor=Default}'s waiting for us. C'mon, Leda,\nlet's go and {SetColor=Gold}explore{SetColor=Default}!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_107_GM_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_107_GM_m02_002: Yes, these {SetColor=Gold}quality materials {SetColor=Default}are very useful indeed!\nWe can sell them or use them when we're resting.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_107_GM_m02_003: What a lovely view. If we {SetColor=Gold}explore {SetColor=Default}more, maybe we'll\nfind more places like this.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_007_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_007_m01_001: If what we heard is true, we should have some time\nbefore Lechner makes his move.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_LG14_007_m01_002: Let's make sure we're prepared for battle. {SetColor=Gold}Speak to\nSirocco when the date arrives.{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m01_001: Sure would be handy if we could {SetColor=Gold}recruit {SetColor=Default}that\n{SetColor=Gold}Catania {SetColor=Default}lady!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m01_002: Indeed. First, we must {SetColor=Gold}increase our renown {SetColor=Default}by\naccepting {SetColor=Gold}requests from the tavern {SetColor=Default}and others.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_104_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_104_m01_001: What's with this white bird?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_105_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_105_m01_001: So...we can see {SetColor=Gold}advice {SetColor=Default}for an {SetColor=Gold}upcoming battle{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_105_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_105_m02_001: Milady, if you're ever feeling uncertain about how to\nspend your free time, refer to the {SetColor=Gold}Adventure Journal{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_Cat_m01_001: Oh, you're back, are you? I suppose we should\npick up where we left off.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_Cat_m01_002: Have you elevated your reputation since then? At\nleast, enough to change my mind about you?
MID_LGA_1LED_LG14_007_Cat_m01: <BLN>You're back, are you?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m02_001: She's consistent, at least... I just wish she wasn't so\ndifficult to win over.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m02_002: It pays to be patient. All we can do for now is\ncontinue trying to {SetColor=Gold}elevate our renown{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_007_m02_003: We don't have time for this... Whatever. I guess I'll\njust keep {SetColor=Gold}performing{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_GM14_008_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c04_GM14_008_m01_001: It seems Lechner is headed to that forsaken\nlakehouse. Let's follow with haste.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_001: Leda, do you think it might be time for us to take\nsome {SetColor=Gold}certification exams{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_002: {SetColor=Gold}Certification exams{SetColor=Default}? What are those?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_003: Tests allowing you to take on different roles. Hunters\nuse bows, diviners use magic, and so on.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_004: When wielded by those with {SetColor=Gold}specialized classing{SetColor=Default},\nweapons will {SetColor=Gold}demonstrate their true power{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_005: Hmmm. I do like the sound of that. It sounds like an\neasy way to {SetColor=Gold}strengthen for battle{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_006: Yes... Though, to {SetColor=Gold}pass an exam{SetColor=Default}, one must {SetColor=Gold}master\nthe skills {SetColor=Default}relevant to the class.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_007: Oh! Uh... That sounds hard. I'm starting to get\nnervous about this whole thing.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m01_008: Never fear! I'll tell you just what to do.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_001: Olympia, what's this all about?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_002: To prepare for an exam, you may {SetColor=Gold}hone your skills{SetColor=Default} at\nthe {SetColor=Gold}training grounds{SetColor=Default}!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_003: By devoting tireless efforts to our training, I daresay\nwe shall have naught to fear of failure!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_004: You're making it sound easy. Expertise doesn't come\novernight.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_005: Nor to those who don't practice. I beseech you,\nLeilidahna, at least try!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m02_006: Alright. I guess I'll head to the {SetColor=Gold}training grounds{SetColor=Default}.\nThe administrator's at the {SetColor=Gold}arena{SetColor=Default}, right?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_Closed_m01_001: Milady, the arena is at the bottom of the stairs.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_Closed_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_Closed_m02_001: Oh, Leilidahna, you've gone past the arena.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m03_001: Excuse me. I heard that we can get some\ntraining here?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m03_002: That's right. Are you here to train?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m03_003: I guess we are. I can take you up on it now,\nthough I'm not really sure how it works.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m03_004: Milady, {SetColor=Gold}it costs money{SetColor=Default} to access the grounds, but I\nwill cover the cost this time.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m04_001: Excuse me. I heard I can get training here?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m04_002: Sure, but {SetColor=Gold}not if you're alone{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m04_003: Oh, really? Damn.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m05_001: If you need a second, I'm happy to train with you.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m05_002: Really? Thanks. I owe you one.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_108_m05_003: Is this your first time using the training grounds?\nThere's usually a {SetColor=Gold}fee{SetColor=Default}, but today it'll be my treat.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m01_001: Heh heh... Now that I've honed my skills, I'd say I'm\nready for a {SetColor=Gold}certification exam{SetColor=Dialogue}.{SetColor=Gold}{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m01_002: You take them near the statue of the Divine\nSovereign in {SetColor=Gold}Upper Temple Row{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1SEO_TG14_109_WrongPerson_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_TG14_109_WrongPerson_m01_001: Leda, I think it's the other one who's in charge of\nthe certification exams.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m02_001: Ah, Leilidahna! To take an exam, you require an\n{SetColor=Gold}exam license for the class {SetColor=Default}you want to qualify for.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m02_002: Ordinarily one would {SetColor=Gold}purchase one from the license\nvendor{SetColor=Default} here.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m02_003: However, as these are special circumstances, I will\npresent you with one of mine.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m02_004: We'll see how this goes. Thanks.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_109_m03_001: Guess it's probably a good idea for us all to take these\nexams as we go, huh?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_008_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_008_m01_001: OK! Let's see if we can {SetColor=Gold}qualify for new classes {SetColor=Default}before\nour match!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_008_m01_002: Remember to check your {SetColor=Gold}Adventure Journal {SetColor=Default}as well\nif you're unsure of what to do.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m01_001: What a smashing success! With that, I'd say we're\nready to begin serving drinks.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m01_002: Allow me to introduce my latest hire. This woman is\nour new {SetColor=Gold}drink vendor{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m02_001: Heya! I'm gonna be making drinks here. Looking\nforward to working with you.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m02_002: No shortage of options. Be sure to have a glass or\nthree before you go anywhere.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m03_001: Sounds great. I'll make sure to come see you when\nI'm in the mood for a {SetColor=Gold}drink{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m03_002: I'd like to add some {SetColor=Gold}new drinks {SetColor=Default}to the menu,\nbut that'll mean I need more {SetColor=Gold}ingredients{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_003_m03_003: We're planning a launch event to celebrate the\nexpanded menu. Would you help gather things?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_001: Leilidahna, there's a place I'd like to visit. Would you\naccompany me there?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_002: Depends on where it is.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_003: The headquarters of the {SetColor=Gold}Vandahl Trading Company{SetColor=Default}!\nIt's near the port. I've long meant to drop by.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_004: One of the empire's leading merchant houses—\nsaid to be able to acquire any item at all.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_005: That may be an exaggeration. But their selection of\nrare equipment and other goods is apparently vast.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_006: Exactly so! Oh, I simply cannot wait any longer.\nI will meet you there!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m01_007: {SetColor=Gray}What happened to having me accompany her?\nI guess I'll just meet her there later.{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m02_001: She said the Vandahl Trading Company's\nheadquarters were {SetColor=Gold}near the port{SetColor=Default}, right?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m02_002: Alright. Then I'll go {SetColor=Gold}down the stairs{SetColor=Default}, into {SetColor=Gold}lowtown{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m03_001: Heeey! Over here, Leda!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Moo_m01_001: Look at this! There are so many things I've never\nseen before. Go talk to the person from the company!
MID_LGA_1LED_TG14_106_Moo_m01: <BLN>Wowow!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Oly_m01_001: Such quality goods, all in exchange for some\nmaterials. I'm so glad we came!
MID_LGA_1LED_TG14_106_Oly_m01: <BLN>What a marvelous place!
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_Sci_m01_001: Hmmm, this could be useful in certain situations.\nBut I mustn't be hasty.
MID_LGA_1LED_TG14_106_Sci_m01: <BLN>Could be useful.
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m04_001: Well? Quite the selection, no? Was there anything\nthat caught your eye?
MID_LGV_1LED_TG14_106_m04_002: You could say that. I'll have to come back again at\nsome point. But that will mean gathering materials.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_009_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_009_m01_001: The more {SetColor=Gold}materials {SetColor=Default}we gather, the more {SetColor=Gold}equipment{SetColor=Default}\nwe can trade them for. We'll become unstoppable!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_009_m01_002: Yes... Though it may also be beneficial to {SetColor=Gold}improve{SetColor=Default}\nthe weapons we have.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_009_m01_003: There is a {SetColor=Gold}blacksmith {SetColor=Default}in Dagsion that can {SetColor=Gold}refine {SetColor=Default}and\n{SetColor=Gold}repair weapons{SetColor=Dialogue} for us.{SetColor=Gold}{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_1LED_c07_LG14_010_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c07_LG14_010_m01_001: I have determined when the ghost carriage will make\nits next move. On that day, we must {SetColor=Gold}ambush them{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c07_LG14_010_m01_003: I have something else on my mind... So it will be Mu\nwho handles this for you.
MID_LGV_1LED_c07_LG14_010_m01_002: When the {SetColor=Gold}date{SetColor=Default} arrives, please {SetColor=Gold}speak with Mu{SetColor=Default}.\nAnd please be prepared.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_010_m02: <TH>
MID_LGA_1LED_LG14_010_m02: <BLN>I must speak with you.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_010_m03: <TH>
MID_LGA_1LED_LG14_010_m03: <BLN>Have you learned anything?
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_LG14_011_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c08_LG14_011_m01_001: Alright, I have to get my hands on {SetColor=Gold}quality ghosh{SetColor=Default}.\nPerhaps the {SetColor=Gold}place to find a drink {SetColor=Default}would be...
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_013_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_013_m01_001: Tonight, I'll look for a chance to sneak past the\nguards by Temple Row.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_013_m01_002: You may come if you wish. But I cannot guarantee\nwe'll learn anything of value.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_LG14_015_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_LG14_015_m01_001: Let's prepare. Then, on the {SetColor=Gold}day of the banquet{SetColor=Default},\nwe'll head to the {SetColor=Gold}Aragonian guesthouse{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_LG14_015_m01_002: Ah! But the guesthouse... Isn't that in the wealthy\npart of town? Will they even let us in?
MID_LGV_1LED_c11_LG14_015_m01_003: It'll be fine. The guards have been told to expect us,\nso they'll {SetColor=Gold}let us into the place this once{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_001: Leda! I've been looking for you. Someone entrusted\nme with something so precious I can't believe it...
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_002: Look—the dancer's necklace. Will you please use it?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_003: That's... That's what I need to get the {SetColor=Gold}dancer {SetColor=Default}class\ncertification! But wasn't it broken?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_004: You must have repaired it. Why would you do that?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_005: You're the reason I kept my tavern going. I wanted to\nrepay you for that.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_006: Besides, your dancing is so captivating, I simply had\nto see more!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_007: Please. Take this and become a {SetColor=Gold}dancer{SetColor=Default}. And then\ncome back and dance for me!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m01_008: Heh heh, you're making me blush. Alright—thanks.\nI'll go and get the certification.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m02_001: I accepted his gift. But... Do I really deserve this?
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m02_002: Is that— It can't be! The dancer's necklace? I never\nimagined I'd see it in person.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m02_003: Anyone who has this is beyond an exam. So...I'll let\nyou skip it. Here's your certification!
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m03_001: <DLG>Received certification for the dancer class.
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_LG14_017_m04_001: Well, now the pressure's on. I have to make sure I\nput this certification to good use.